    "默认补空白资料、追加标签。已有不同值保留，改名需要单独选择。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认补空白资料、追加标签。已有不同值保留，改名需要单独选择。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設補空白資料、追加標籤。已有不同值保留，改名需要單獨選擇。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empty fields are filled and tags are appended by default. Existing different values are kept; renames require a separate choice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认补空白资料、追加标签。已有不同值保留，改名需要单独选择。仅保存已选择的改动。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认补空白资料、追加标签。已有不同值保留，改名需要单独选择。仅保存已选择的改动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設補上空白資料、追加標籤。已有不同值會保留，重新命名需另行選擇。僅儲存已選擇的變更。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default, fill empty information and append tags. Existing different values are kept, and renaming requires a separate choice. Only selected changes are saved."
          }
        }
      }
    }
